<text class="node-detail-soft" x="256" y="322">Board approval for €4–6m upfront structuring spend</text>

<line x1="420" y1="336" x2="420" y2="370" stroke="#B8C2CC" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
<text class="arrow-label" x="432" y="359">PASS</text>

<path d="M600,276 L680,276" fill="none" stroke="#B8C2CC" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
<text class="arrow-label-fail" x="616" y="270">FAIL</text>

<rect x="680" y="252" width="180" height="58" rx="2" fill="#6E6E6E"/>
<text class="kill-heading" x="770" y="275" text-anchor="middle">Restructure or defer</text>
<text class="kill-sub" x="770" y="291" text-anchor="middle">Rework legal structure;</text>
<text class="kill-sub" x="770" y="303" text-anchor="middle">re-engage rating agencies</text>

<!-- GATE 2 -->
<rect x="240" y="374" width="360" height="120" rx="2" fill="#003D7A"/>
<text class="node-title" x="256" y="396">GATE 2 · FIRST MILESTONE (M12)</text>
<line x1="256" y1="404" x2="584" y2="404" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="0.6" opacity="0.3"/>
<text class="node-detail" x="256" y="424">First SPV draw executed at €200–300m</text>
<text class="node-detail" x="256" y="442">First Redesign contract signed at ≤6bps concession</text>
<text class="node-detail" x="256" y="460">FFO/debt trajectory ≥40% at end-2025</text>
<text class="node-detail-soft" x="256" y="480">Single-obligor concentration ≤10% of pool</text>

<line x1="420" y1="494" x2="420" y2="528" stroke="#B8C2CC" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
<text class="arrow-label" x="432" y="517">PASS</text>

<path d="M600,434 L680,434" fill="none" stroke="#B8C2CC" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
<text class="arrow-label-fail" x="616" y="428">FAIL</text>

<rect x="680" y="408" width="180" height="62" rx="2" fill="#6E6E6E"/>
<text class="kill-heading" x="770" y="430" text-anchor="middle">Single-track fallback</text>
<text class="kill-sub" x="770" y="446" text-anchor="middle">SPV fail → Track B solo</text>
<text class="kill-sub" x="770" y="460" text-anchor="middle">Redesign fail → Track A solo</text>

<!-- MONITORING BAND -->
<rect x="80" y="532" width="600" height="84" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#003D7A" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
<text class="mon-kpi-title" x="100" y="554">ONGOING MONITORING · M12 TO M24</text>
<line x1="100" y1="562" x2="660" y2="562" stroke="#003D7A" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.3"/>
<text class="mon-kpi" x="100" y="580">Quarterly KPIs reported to Finance Committee:</text>
<text class="mon-kpi-em" x="100" y="600">NFR days · SPV utilisation vs 85% · Track B cap · FFO/debt · pool concentration</text>

<path d="M695,574 L770,574" fill="none" stroke="#B8C2CC" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
<text class="arrow-label-fail" x="700" y="568">TRIGGER</text>

<rect x="770" y="548" width="90" height="52" rx="2" fill="#6E6E6E"/>
<text class="kill-sub" x="815" y="568" text-anchor="middle">Programme</text>
<text class="kill-sub" x="815" y="582" text-anchor="middle">pause and</text>
<text class="kill-sub" x="815" y="596" text-anchor="middle">escalate</text>

<line x1="420" y1="616" x2="420" y2="646" stroke="#B8C2CC" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>

<!-- GATE 3: wider 360px -->
<rect x="240" y="650" width="360" height="90" rx="2" fill="#003D7A"/>
<text class="node-title" x="256" y="672">GATE 3 · SCALE DECISION (M25–M36)</text>
<line x1="256" y1="680" x2="584" y2="680" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="0.6" opacity="0.3"/>
<text class="node-detail" x="256" y="700">Track B concession distribution from 3+ contracts</text>
<text class="node-detail-soft" x="256" y="720">&lt;10bps cluster → scale; near Sibilkov mean → terminate</text>

<line x1="420" y1="740" x2="420" y2="770" stroke="#B8C2CC" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
<text class="arrow-label" x="432" y="761">&lt; 10bps</text>

<path d="M600,690 L680,690" fill="none" stroke="#B8C2CC" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
<text class="arrow-label-fail" x="614" y="684">≥ 10bps</text>

<rect x="680" y="666" width="180" height="50" rx="2" fill="#6E6E6E"/>
<text class="kill-heading" x="770" y="688" text-anchor="middle">Terminate Track B</text>
<text class="kill-sub" x="770" y="704" text-anchor="middle">Track A continues at steady state</text>

<rect x="280" y="772" width="280" height="44" rx="2" fill="#00A651"/>
<text class="end-label" x="420" y="799" text-anchor="middle">Full hybrid at steady state</text>
